  "notes": "Cash basis county, governmental funds only. Statement lines from the Total Governmental Funds column (p4); beginning/ending cash are the cash basis fund balances (cash 4,462,440 + investments 4,091,301 at year end, p3); ending_investments is informational and already inside ending_cash. Taxes 7,757,040 has no printed tax-type breakdown: Inheritance Fund taxes (inheritance tax) and Visitors Promotion Fund taxes (lodging tax) split by fund name; 911 fund taxes left unlabeled (no surcharge note in the trim). Public Works mapped to streets/highways. Balance sheet from the governmental funds Statement of Cash Basis Assets and Fund Balances (p3), totals equal the Statement of Net Position (p1). Detail: General Fund budget schedule (pp5-6; zero-actual Employment Security and Institutions omitted), major funds budget schedules (pp7-8), nonmajor funds (29 funds) from the combining statement Total Nonmajor Funds column (p20) instead of the one-line nonmajor budget schedules (pp9-15). Read pages 1-20 of 20"
